{"id":"b6312285c945cdf9","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-dynamic-decomposition.md","title":"动态差集分解与可枚举性","display":"thm-dynamic-decomposition — 动态差集分解与可枚举性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-dynamic-decomposition","aliases":["20-thm-dynamic-decomposition"],"display":"thm-dynamic-decomposition — 动态差集分解与可枚举性","chapter":"2","section":"2.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.6.7(i),(ii)","source_printed_pages":[48],"source_pdf_pages":[84],"depends_on":["[[20-df-dynamic-differences]]","[[20-thm-re-proj]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-dynamic-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-dynamic-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dynamic-decomposition — 动态差集分解与可枚举性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.6.7(i),(ii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>48</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>84</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9190004194115561\" href=\"?note=9190004194115561\" title=\"20-df-dynamic-differences\">20-df-dynamic-differences</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17d2f06d43a19f1e\" href=\"?note=17d2f06d43a19f1e\" title=\"20-thm-re-proj\">20-thm-re-proj</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)\">\\(\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=V_e\">\\(X=V_e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=V_j\">\\(Y=V_j\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9190004194115561\" href=\"?note=9190004194115561\" title=\"20-df-dynamic-differences\">20-df-dynamic-differences</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"17d2f06d43a19f1e\" href=\"?note=17d2f06d43a19f1e\" title=\"20-thm-re-proj\">20-thm-re-proj</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j),\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\ \\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j)=(X\\setminus Y)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j).\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j),\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\ \\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j)=(X\\setminus Y)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j).\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Before 的成员性由某个有限阶段的可判定条件见证；Flow 还等待该元素进入 Y，因此两者 c.e.。Before 的每个元素按最终是否在 Y 分入两边；不在 Y 的 X 元素在自身出现时必被记录。两边不交，因为一边位于 Y 外，另一边位于 Y 内。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.6.7(i),(ii)；印刷页 48；PDF 第 84 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-dynamic-differences","status":"resolved","id":"9190004194115561","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-dynamic-differences]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-re-proj","status":"resolved","id":"17d2f06d43a19f1e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-re-proj]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-dynamic-differences","status":"resolved","id":"9190004194115561","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dynamic-differences]]；see [[20-thm-re-proj]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-re-proj","status":"resolved","id":"17d2f06d43a19f1e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dynamic-differences]]；see [[20-thm-re-proj]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)","display":false},{"tex":"X=V_e","display":false},{"tex":"Y=V_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j),\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\ \\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j)=(X\\setminus Y)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j).\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1404,"backlinks":[{"id":"e8aedee3e7e32f49","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-dynamic-decomposition]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-thm-re-closure]]。"}],"outgoing":["9190004194115561","17d2f06d43a19f1e"]}